# The OEWS normalized snapshot is 12 MB — larger than the application itself.
# Its provenance lives in data/bls-oews/raw (the archives BLS served plus their
# digests) and its identity in data/bls-oews/manifest.json. Regenerate it with
# `npm run data:oews:rebuild`, which refuses to write a snapshot that does not
# hash to the promoted value.
data/bls-oews/snapshots/

# CMS Marketplace plan-attribute archives are 72 MB of provider zips, downloaded
# for a county-level benchmark Silver premium pipeline that does not exist yet.
# The ACA calculator reads only data/aca-subsidy/2026.json — the IRS contribution
# table and HHS poverty guidelines — which is small, reviewed, and committed.
# Re-download these from the CMS public use files when that pipeline is built.
data/cms-marketplace/raw/
